"relationship": "same_topic",
"comparison": "Both BAC and C disclose consolidation of credit card securitization trusts. BAC includes credit cards as part of its whole-loan securitization trusts where it acts as servicer and holds significant interests, leading to consolidation. C explicitly consolidates its Credit Card Master Trust and Omni Trust because, as servicer, it has the power to direct significant activities and holds seller's interests/securities that expose it to potentially significant losses or benefits.",
